.TH TELEBIT-SETUP 1 "2026-09-09" "telebit" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
telebit-setup \- switch on and check the Telebit Vietnamese input method
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B telebit-setup
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B telebit-setup
is the window half of Telebit, the Vietnamese Telex/VNI input method for
Fcitx 5. It has two pages, which answer the two different questions someone
has after installing it.
.TP
.B Cài đặt (Setup)
Whether Telebit is switched on in Fcitx 5, with a button that adds it to the
current input-method group; the choice between the Telex and VNI layouts; and
the typing options (spell-check restore, modern tone placement, automatic
sentence capitalisation, direct commit, AI assistant). Changes are written to
Fcitx 5 immediately over its D-Bus interface, the same one
.BR fcitx5-configtool (1)
uses, and take effect without a restart.
.IP
Macros, the per-application preedit list and the key bindings are not shown
here; the page has a button that opens Fcitx 5's own configuration page for
Telebit, where they live.
.TP
.B Trạng thái (Status)
The report
.BR telebit (1)
produces, rendered as a list rather than a table: the session's input-method
environment, the running compositor, Fcitx 5 itself, the modules present on the
host, and what each Flatpak and Snap sandbox can see. A switch turns on the
deep probe, which enters each sandbox and reads its environment for real. A
button copies the whole report as Markdown for pasting into a bug report.
.PP
The window is not required in order to use Telebit; everything it does can be
done with
.BR fcitx5-configtool (1)
and
.BR telebit (1).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AI_API_KEY\fR, \fBANTHROPIC_API_KEY\fR, \fBCLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN
Credentials for the optional AI assistant, which is off by default. They are
read from the environment and never stored in Telebit's configuration. See the
documentation for the full list of AI_* variables.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR telebit (1),
.BR fcitx5 (1),
.BR fcitx5-configtool (1),
.BR im-config (8)
.PP
Full documentation at
.UR https://sonnam0904.github.io/telebit/
.UE .
